WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:05.195
THE GENERAL LINE

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:10.195
Film in 6 parts

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:15.195
A SOVKINO production

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:17.112
Script and Direction:

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:20.193
S. M. EISENSTEIN
and G. V. ALEXANDROV

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.278
Camera:
EDOUARD TISSE

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.436
Assistant directors:

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:29.719
M. S. GOMOROV and
M. M. CHTRAOUKH

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:32.275
Architect: A. K. BOUROV

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:35.717
Sets: V. I. KOVRIGUINE
and V. A. RAKHALS

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:37.751
"...On some occasions,

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:39.712
the exemplary organisation

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:42.753
of local work,
even on a small scale,

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.394
turns out to be
more efficient for the State

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.909
than a large number
of State institutions

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:50.429
under centralized control."
V. Lenin

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:55.515
Not ten

00:00:55.716 --> 00:00:57.016
not twenty

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:58.189
but

00:00:58.400 --> 00:00:59.753
one hundred

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:01.359
one hundred MILLION

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:04.996
illiterate,
ignorant,

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.156
old-fashioned

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:09.510
peasants,

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:13.279
old-fashioned peasants

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:15.391
left as a legacy

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:18.114
by the old system!

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:20.390
The precariousness

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:22.750
The poverty

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:56.558
And still nowadays
in our time

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:47.557
When a brother leaves
his brother

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:01.752
The farm is split
half-and-half

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:29.589
Half-and-half, thus half-and-half

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:57.879
The land in shreds

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:17.556
The Sharing

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:37.755
So the farms
grow poorer and collapse

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:06.830
One among many

00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:15.469
Marfa Lapkina

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:31.148
Inventory:

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:32.398
Horses: None

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:33.738
Cows: 1

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:35.078
Plow: None

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:36.496
Swing plow: 1

00:09:36.797 --> 00:09:37.797
Harrow: None

00:09:55.520 --> 00:09:57.158
And outside

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:02.838
Spring

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:10.710
The peasant's spring

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:14.468
Hopeless without a horse

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:27.036
She has to beg for one

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:02.397
It is not given

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:47.353
Summer

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:02.514
And no horse!

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:20.199
No horse

00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:30.232
In despair

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:58.311
No horse!

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:06.271
It's impossible!

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:11.037
Impossible!

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:13.238
IMPOSSIBLE!

00:20:13.239 --> 00:20:13.939
like this

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.136
to live

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:21.156
It's impossible
to live like this!

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:29.076
It's impossible
to live seperately.

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:37.755
We must live together

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:45.109
Woman!

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:49.399
Together!

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:14.234
The Party committee
decides...

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:21.156
to support
Lapkina's proposition

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:25.473
about the creation
of a dairy cooperative...

00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:46.950
Taxes aren't
enough for you!

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:53.797
You want the milk
from the last cow!

00:22:00.080 --> 00:22:01.911
Another Soviet trick!

00:22:17.960 --> 00:22:20.190
The local agriculturist

00:22:22.440 --> 00:22:25.716
Comrades
Paupers and peasants!

00:22:37.480 --> 00:22:41.951
A dairy cooperative
would be a great help for you.

00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:50.752
Who's for it?

00:24:24.600 --> 00:24:28.036
I declare
the dairy cooperative

00:24:28.240 --> 00:24:29.878
officially started!

00:24:34.880 --> 00:24:40.398
Dairy cooperative
"The October Way"

00:24:55.760 --> 00:24:57.557
Drought.

00:31:07.240 --> 00:31:08.958
There it goes...

00:31:12.000 --> 00:31:14.116
a cloud, passing by chance

00:34:10.400 --> 00:34:12.356
Deception?..

00:34:36.240 --> 00:34:38.356
With the first loan

00:35:22.480 --> 00:35:23.515
A SEPARATOR

00:35:28.120 --> 00:35:29.758
that will give the means

00:35:33.680 --> 00:35:36.035
to make butter.

00:36:37.800 --> 00:36:40.234
Deception or advance?

00:36:42.760 --> 00:36:44.352
DECEPTION?

00:36:57.560 --> 00:36:58.595
Or...

00:37:04.320 --> 00:37:05.435
ADVANCE

00:37:19.280 --> 00:37:20.952
It's going to condense!

00:37:25.000 --> 00:37:25.796
Or

00:37:28.200 --> 00:37:30.634
NOT?!

00:39:09.680 --> 00:39:10.396
It has condensed!!

00:39:13.080 --> 00:39:13.910
CONDENSED!!!

00:39:41.520 --> 00:39:42.794
And

00:39:43.000 --> 00:39:44.877
An increase

00:39:45.080 --> 00:39:46.798
of cooperative members

00:40:01.320 --> 00:40:02.912
Congratulations

00:40:05.080 --> 00:40:07.719
The dairy cooperative
worked...

00:41:05.440 --> 00:41:08.000
With the first profit!..

00:41:53.520 --> 00:42:00.551
Don't dare distribute
the money of the cooperative!

00:42:07.000 --> 00:42:10.595
The money will be totally wasted!

00:42:21.520 --> 00:42:24.557
Give back the money!

00:44:39.600 --> 00:44:41.158
What will you do with the money?!

00:44:41.360 --> 00:44:42.873
Spend it on drink!

00:46:11.160 --> 00:46:16.393
And what about the pedigree bull?

00:46:19.880 --> 00:46:27.355
How are we going to
set up the bovine cooperative?

00:48:50.520 --> 00:48:55.036
I'll watch over the money,
and we will have that bull!

00:55:42.920 --> 00:55:48.199
Perhaps you think it's a dream?

00:55:52.880 --> 00:55:55.155
Nothing of the kind

00:56:18.160 --> 00:56:18.851
It's

00:56:19.052 --> 00:56:19.852
a sovkhoz (a state farm)

00:57:59.160 --> 00:58:01.435
Name - Fomka

00:58:56.240 --> 00:58:59.152
And so, the dairy cooperative

00:58:59.360 --> 00:59:03.319
evolved into a bovine cooperative.

00:59:09.080 --> 00:59:11.196
Out of a palace

00:59:11.400 --> 00:59:14.153
of industry

00:59:23.880 --> 00:59:26.519
from a huge factory

00:59:33.680 --> 00:59:36.558
the workers on holiday

00:59:41.800 --> 00:59:44.553
came to help
with the construction

00:59:52.800 --> 00:59:55.519
in the sponsored village.

01:00:25.240 --> 01:00:29.313
With its director in the lead,

01:00:59.680 --> 01:01:01.716
the kolkhoz (collective farm)

01:01:01.920 --> 01:01:05.993
builds a common cow-shed.

01:01:11.600 --> 01:01:13.591
The sponsors

01:01:23.640 --> 01:01:27.713
set up a grain sorter.

01:01:38.680 --> 01:01:41.752
-We have to extend the farm.

01:01:45.160 --> 01:01:50.598
-We have to work the land
together, with a tractor.

01:01:58.160 --> 01:02:00.151
-It's about time!

01:02:01.720 --> 01:02:04.837
The old ones object.

01:02:19.760 --> 01:02:22.399
-Why a tractor?!

01:02:55.080 --> 01:02:57.799
-I am myself a machine!

01:03:02.240 --> 01:03:03.673
-Look at my hands!

01:03:47.240 --> 01:03:52.155
Little by little they get used
to working together

01:04:14.600 --> 01:04:16.830
Sorting out the grain
for sowing.

01:04:49.430 --> 01:04:52.228
Preparations
for the wedding

01:05:56.830 --> 01:05:57.626
She's coming!

01:06:13.270 --> 01:06:13.827
She's coming!

01:06:16.150 --> 01:06:17.981
The bride

01:06:24.990 --> 01:06:25.502
She's coming!

01:06:28.270 --> 01:06:29.498
The bride

01:06:57.830 --> 01:06:58.421
THE BRIDE

01:07:13.110 --> 01:07:13.781
THE BRIDE

01:07:44.430 --> 01:07:45.909
THE GROOM

01:11:12.750 --> 01:11:15.662
A summer day
supplies winter food

01:12:08.350 --> 01:12:09.499
Jarov

01:12:19.870 --> 01:12:23.499
No better reaper
in the area

01:12:50.590 --> 01:12:51.739
Jarov!

01:12:56.390 --> 01:12:57.459
I'm going to catch you

01:15:05.830 --> 01:15:06.501
I've caught you!

01:16:36.230 --> 01:16:37.504
The machine

01:16:42.630 --> 01:16:44.985
beats me and you...

01:16:47.790 --> 01:16:49.303
The machine!

01:17:22.390 --> 01:17:23.789
It cuts the grass

01:17:36.790 --> 01:17:38.189
turns it over

01:18:07.110 --> 01:18:08.145
and picks it up

01:18:08.350 --> 01:18:10.261
Autumn

01:18:44.070 --> 01:18:46.026
The time has come
to harvest

01:19:04.990 --> 01:19:06.787
If only we had
a machine!

01:19:09.270 --> 01:19:13.087
In response to your request,

01:19:13.190 --> 01:19:16.182
you will find hereafter
our answer...

01:19:19.990 --> 01:19:25.000
...once the aforementioned overhead
has been paid,

01:19:25.110 --> 01:19:30.066
the tractor will be delivered
to the cooperative immediately...

01:19:47.750 --> 01:19:50.423
And they hastened
to help...

01:20:58.510 --> 01:21:04.540
Obviously the loan

01:21:05.041 --> 01:21:10.041
cannot be granted

01:21:11.270 --> 01:21:20.065
before the harvest
has been gathered

01:21:23.390 --> 01:21:25.824
We advise you to apply

01:21:26.030 --> 01:21:27.986
to the appropriate authorities

01:21:28.190 --> 01:21:30.420
With comradely regards..

01:21:58.630 --> 01:22:01.098
Gathering the harvest

01:22:39.110 --> 01:22:41.226
Time has been lost

01:22:41.430 --> 01:22:44.388
in paying back
the expenses for the tractor.

01:24:52.070 --> 01:24:57.064
Less political chatter!

01:25:12.470 --> 01:25:16.986
On fighting
against bureaucracy

01:25:54.470 --> 01:25:59.464
Marfa goes to town
as a delegate

01:26:04.630 --> 01:26:06.860
to get hold of the tractor

01:26:08.550 --> 01:26:10.108
40 versts...

01:26:12.030 --> 01:26:14.021
And 140 more...

01:26:21.110 --> 01:26:23.749
Up to the town to implore
the sponsors to help

01:27:16.550 --> 01:27:19.508
We'll be left
without a tractor!

01:27:41.350 --> 01:27:45.104
The cooperative
fed Fomka

01:27:59.110 --> 01:28:02.739
and Fomka
fed the cooperative.

01:28:06.190 --> 01:28:07.259
And so

01:28:07.470 --> 01:28:09.938
the kulaks made a plan.

01:29:23.830 --> 01:29:26.139
Henchmen carried it out.

01:30:45.270 --> 01:30:46.259
Service

01:30:50.310 --> 01:30:51.379
of Agricultural

01:30:54.510 --> 01:30:55.499
Restocking

01:31:01.390 --> 01:31:02.379
and Loan

01:31:08.630 --> 01:31:09.506
for Machines

01:31:11.670 --> 01:31:14.264
SerAgrReLoMac

01:32:10.350 --> 01:32:12.864
DO NOT ENTER WITHOUT
A CONTRIBUTION

01:33:37.590 --> 01:33:38.545
Apply

01:33:39.630 --> 01:33:41.063
the general

01:33:42.430 --> 01:33:43.465
line

01:33:49.510 --> 01:33:49.724
R.

01:33:50.125 --> 01:33:50.425
K.

01:33:50.726 --> 01:33:51.126
I.

01:33:51.327 --> 01:33:51.927
of the R.K.I.

01:34:18.270 --> 01:34:20.067
We have the order!

01:34:24.790 --> 01:34:26.985
The order for the tractor

01:34:34.150 --> 01:34:35.981
Thanks to the workers!

01:34:48.150 --> 01:34:52.223
MACHINE
COOPERATIVE

01:36:28.430 --> 01:36:30.625
We will use witchcraft...

01:38:22.590 --> 01:38:23.943
He is dead...

01:39:04.670 --> 01:39:06.223
We have a tractor!

01:39:06.724 --> 01:39:07.324
We have it!

01:41:06.390 --> 01:41:08.904
Fomka is no more...

01:41:16.110 --> 01:41:17.987
but

01:41:56.590 --> 01:41:57.989
he is alive!

01:42:03.190 --> 01:42:05.067
He is alive!

01:42:06.710 --> 01:42:08.382
HE LIVES!

01:42:10.910 --> 01:42:13.982
The "bovine cooperative" lives!

01:42:19.030 --> 01:42:19.906
At last

01:42:35.710 --> 01:42:40.261
"Let's tighten up the links
with the country"

01:42:40.470 --> 01:42:42.825
The sponsors' speech

01:43:07.550 --> 01:43:09.825
and the hero of the day

01:51:47.190 --> 01:51:49.658
Let's show what we can do!

01:52:07.950 --> 01:52:10.180
And meanwhile -
the young communists

01:56:34.150 --> 01:56:35.981
Hurrah for collective work!

01:56:36.190 --> 01:56:38.465
On a collective land!

01:56:50.230 --> 01:56:53.427
Together with the industry!

01:57:47.790 --> 01:57:48.825
The land

01:57:53.910 --> 01:57:54.979
Hurrah!

01:58:06.430 --> 01:58:07.783
Hurrah for the land!!!

01:59:53.150 --> 01:59:54.788
Marfa

02:00:35.790 --> 02:00:39.578
That's how
boundaries vanish

02:00:39.790 --> 02:00:42.099
between city and country.

02:00:49.950 --> 02:00:51.702
THE END
